        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Limitations of the Study</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #ececec;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    color: #101010;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 608px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: white;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .slide {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 304px;\n    background: #fff;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .topnav {\n    height: 29px;\n    background: #304e82;\n    color: white;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.38fr .9fr;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 0 39px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n  .topnav div { white-space: nowrap; }\n  .topnav .active {\n    position: relative;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .topnav .active:after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 50%;\n    bottom: -8px;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    border-left: 4px solid transparent;\n    border-right: 4px solid transparent;\n    border-top: 8px solid #304e82;\n  }\n  .content {\n    padding: 10px 45px 0 45px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    line-height: 24px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n  .point {\n    margin: 0 0 0 21px;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 23px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #d11414;\n  }\n  .point .letter {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 21px;\n    margin-left: -21px;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    margin: 1px 0 0 41px;\n    font-size: 11.4px;\n    line-height: 21px;\n  }\n  .bullet {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n  }\n  .bullet:before {\n    content: \"•\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .bold { font-weight: 700; }\n  .subhead {\n    position: relative;\n    margin: 3px 0 3px 21px;\n    color: #3a4f70;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 21px;\n  }\n  .subhead:before {\n    content: \"→\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -21px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #59626d;\n  }\n  .letter-list {\n    margin: 3px 0 0 42px;\n    padding: 0;\n    list-style: none;\n    font-size: 11.4px;\n    line-height: 21px;\n  }\n  .letter-list li { position: relative; }\n  .letter-list .n {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 16px;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    height: 30px;\n    padding: 0 46px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1.15fr .82fr 1.15fr 18px;\n    align-items: end;\n    color: #d2d2d2;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n  .footer .item {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-top: 7px;\n    border-top: 2px solid #d4d4d4;\n  }\n  .footer .current {\n    color: #1c1c1c;\n    border-top-color: #344d70;\n  }\n  .footer .page-no {\n    padding-bottom: 1px;\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    color: #c2c2c2;\n  }\n  .second .content { padding-top: 10px; }\n  .second .point { line-height: 22px; }\n  .second .indent { margin-top: 2px; line-height: 20px; }\n  .second .subhead {\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n    line-height: 21px;\n  }\n  .second .subhead span { display: block; }\n  .second .subbullet {\n    margin: 0 0 0 41px;\n    padding-left: 17px;\n    position: relative;\n    font-size: 10.7px;\n    line-height: 20px;\n  }\n  .second .subbullet:before {\n    content: \"✓\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <section class=\"slide first\">\n    <div class=\"topnav\">\n      <div>Novelty &amp; Significance</div>\n      <div class=\"active\">Limitations of the Study</div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:right;\">Future Work</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h1>Limitations</h1>\n      <div class=\"point\"><span class=\"letter\">b.</span>Approximately 25% of enrolled patients were unable to proceed to<br>vaccination:</div>\n      <div class=\"indent bullet\">\n        The majority due to either disease progression or inability to generate<br>\n        vaccines because of <span class=\"bold\">low tumor content in the biopsy samples or a low<br>number of mutations.</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"subhead\">Opportunities to mitigate this issue include:</div>\n      <ul class=\"letter-list\">\n        <li><span class=\"n\">a.</span>Acceleration of vaccine production timelines</li>\n        <li><span class=\"n\">b.</span>Incorporation of potentially higher-yield tumor sampling approaches</li>\n        <li><span class=\"n\">c.</span>Selection of alternative clinical settings can be envisioned</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <div class=\"item\">Background</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">Study Design</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">Result</div>\n      <div class=\"item current\">Conclusion</div>\n      <div class=\"page-no\">39</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"slide second\">\n    <div class=\"topnav\">\n      <div>Novelty &amp; Significance</div>\n      <div class=\"active\">Limitations of the Study</div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:right;\">Future Work</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h1>Limitations</h1>\n      <div class=\"point\"><span class=\"letter\">c.</span>It is unclear whether pre-vaccine nivolumab contributed to vaccine-<br>induced T cell responses:</div>\n      <div class=\"indent bullet\">\n        Major pathologic responses were noted post-vaccination melanoma<br>\n        patients who did not initially respond to nivolumab.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"subhead\">\n        <span>Refining the sequence of different agents in combination</span>\n        <span>immunotherapy for best clinical outcomes needs further study.</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"subbullet\">\n        Alternative immuno-oncologic agents, such as anti-CTLA-4, that can preferentially<br>\n        expand naïve CD8+ T cells to increase the T cell pool for vaccine priming, might be<br>\n        better a choice for pre-vaccine immunotherapy.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <div class=\"item\">Background</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">Study Design</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">Result</div>\n      <div class=\"item current\">Conclusion</div>\n      <div class=\"page-no\">40</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
